# Set C review-pair key — ESCROWED. Do not open until your calls are recorded
# (export review-responses.js from review.html?set=C first).
# Cross-res pairs p17-p22: the SMALLER-resolution side was bilinear-upscaled to
# the common canvas; the higher rung is shown native (pre-registered choice).

- pair: p01
  L: X1b_p1  R: X1a_p1
  contrast: X1: simple/20 vs sgm_uniform/20 (P1 low)
  expected: A1: near-twins (max|dS|=0.052) -> tie or small difference

- pair: p02
  L: c1_canary_start  R: X1b_p2
  contrast: X1: simple/20 vs sgm_uniform/20 (P2 med)
  expected: near-twins -> tie or small difference

- pair: p03
  L: X1b_p3  R: X1a_p3
  contrast: X1: simple/20 vs sgm_uniform/20 (P3 high)
  expected: near-twins -> tie or small difference

- pair: p04
  L: X1d1_p1  R: X1a_p1
