  expected: the mid-band treatment: X1 hypothesis = beta >= simple on motion, no fry

- pair: p05
  L: X1d1_p2  R: c1_canary_start
  contrast: X1: simple/20 vs beta(2,4)/20 (P2 med)
  expected: mid-band treatment; fry axis = skin/texture

- pair: p06
