  expected: mid-band treatment at high motion

- pair: p07
  L: __SETB_R9__  R: c2_canary_mid
  contrast: NULL: mid canary vs Set B canonical
  expected: expected TIE — identical config, pixel-identical by construction (the p-null gate)

